B7 trip and latch: +HV_RAW ramps through the trip level, then falls back
.include models.lib
Vin IN 0 PWL(0 0 0.2m 9)
R2 IN UVLO 49.9k
R3 UVLO 0 12.4k
C13 UVLO 0 220p
* latch: Q6 MMBT3904, Q7 MMBT3906, R52 100k, R53 10k, C35 10n
Q6 QPB G 0 Q3904
Q7 G QPB UVLO Q3906
R52 UVLO QPB 100k
R53 G 0 10k
C35 G 0 10n
* COMP pull-up
Vpu VPU 0 6.8
R4 VPU COMP 5.11k
* rail: steady 102.5 V, fault ramp at 5 V/ms from 1 ms, falls once switching stops (UVLO < 1.4 V)
Vr HV0 0 PWL(0 102.5 1m 102.5 3m 112.5)
Bhv HI 0 V=V(HV0)
XTP HI 0 COMP G KTP TRB CTR=1
.control
tran 1u 4m
wrdata b7.dat v(hi) v(g) v(uvlo) v(comp)
meas tran v_trip find v(hi) when v(uvlo)=1.4 fall=1
meas tran t_trip when v(uvlo)=1.4 fall=1
meas tran pre_uvlo find v(uvlo) at=0.9m
meas tran pre_g find v(g) at=0.9m
meas tran uvlo_end find v(uvlo) at=4m
meas tran g_end find v(g) at=4m
.endc
.end
